ly, thereby improving his grades.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ increasing = ez\u00e1ltal n\u00f6velve (pl. The new policy was implemented, thereby increasing profits.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ causing = ez\u00e1ltal okozva (pl. The accident was caused by negligence, thereby causing significant damage.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ leading to = ez\u00e1ltal vezetve ahhoz (pl. The experiment was a success, thereby leading to a breakthrough.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>thereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: thereby increasing \/ thereby improving \/ thereby causing \/ thereby leading<\/span><\/p><p>similar: thus \/ hence \/ therefore \/ consequently<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: preventing \/ hindering \/ obstructing<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":10,"ease_factor":190,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-30","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20","due_at":"2026-05-30T21:26:59+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-20T21:22:22+00:00","interval":5,"ease_factor":190,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-30","reviewed_on":"2026-05-15"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"12 nap","good":"19 nap","easy":"25 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-13T14:58:56+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/34\/study","version":"4733b06ae4b376c32fb6cdf16e3cd641","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div>